            "title": "Primary source",
            "text": "A primary source is original material that has not been altered."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "A research paper written by the scientists who did the study is a primary source; a summary of it written by someone else is a secondary source."
          }
        ]
      }
